e with one. Try to make friends with another one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>ITEMS</strong></i><br>Games should have cool stuff. Like swords, or, sometimes, acorns. Stuff to use, collect, fight with, or solve puzzles with. In Devil\u2019s Terminal, most of those things were not designed to make sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/extras/kids.gif?t=1751393371\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["\ud835\ude3f\ud835\ude4d\ud835\ude3c\ud835\ude48\ud835\ude3c"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171510/header.jpg?t=1751393371","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155806,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155806/movie480.mp4?t=1749707425","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155806/movie_max.mp4?t=1749707425"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155806/d055b81dc1ccb2fb4a58175ff607e498e44a9485/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749707425","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155806/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749707425","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155806/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749707425"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257046413,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046413/movie480.mp4?t=17